This package bundles no third-party code or data. It depends on the following packages, which
are installed alongside it under their own licences:

Runtime dependencies
  zod                 MIT           https://github.com/colinhacks/zod
  libphonenumber-js   MIT           https://gitlab.com/catamphetamine/libphonenumber-js
                      Its phone number metadata is derived from Google's libphonenumber
                      (Apache License 2.0, https://github.com/google/libphonenumber).

Optional peer dependencies (only for reading files with /node)
  pdfjs-dist          Apache-2.0    https://github.com/mozilla/pdf.js
  pdf-parse           Apache-2.0    https://github.com/mehmet-kozan/pdf-parse
  mammoth             BSD-2-Clause  https://github.com/mwilliamson/mammoth.js

Education levels follow the International Standard Classification of Education (ISCED 2011),
published by UNESCO. The level numbers are referenced, not reproduced.

The language and region packs, the community policy and the test resumes were written for this
package. The resumes describe invented people and companies.
